msgid ""
"C-RTK2 HP is a heading and RTK receiver designed and manufactured by CUAV. "
"The difference from F9P is that it only needs one module to realize GPS for "
"yaw. C-RTK2 HP also supports UART and Dronecan connection methods."
msgstr ""
"C-RTK2 HP 是由 CUAV 设计和制造的航向与 RTK 接收机。与 F9P 的区别在于它只需一个模块即可实现 GPS 偏航。C-RTK2 HP "
"还支持 UART 和 DroneCAN 连接方式。"

